white shadow rounded border hover:border-orange-500 transition\">Gandhidham</span>\n                <span class=\"p-3 bg-white shadow rounded border hover:border-orange-500 transition\">Morbi</span>\n                <span class=\"p-3 bg-white shadow rounded border hover:border-orange-500 transition\">Surendranagar</span>\n                <span class=\"p-3 bg-white shadow rounded border hover:border-orange-500 transition\">Patan</span>\n                <span class=\"p-3 bg-white shadow rounded border hover:border-orange-500 transition\">Dahod</span>\n                <span class=\"p-3 bg-white shadow rounded border hover:border-orange-500 transition\">Porbandar</span>\n                <span class=\"p-3 bg-white shadow rounded border hover:border-orange-500 transition\">Godhra</span>\n                <span class=\"p-3 bg-white shadow rounded border hover:border-orange-500 transition\">Veraval</span>\n                <span class=\"p-3 bg-white shadow rounded border hover:border-orange-500 transition\">Botad</span>\n                <span class=\"p-3 bg-white shadow rounded border hover:border-orange-500 transition\">Palanpur</span>\n                <span class=\"p-3 bg-white shadow rounded border hover:border-orange-500 transition\">Vapi</span>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQ SECTION (10 NOS) -->\n        <section id=\"faqs\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-blue-900 mb-16 uppercase text-center\">FAQ: air cooler repair services gujarat</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto\">\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-lg border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\">1. Does Atlas Aircon cover all of Gujarat?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 leading-relaxed\">Yes, we provide <span class=\"highlight-orange\">air cooler repair services gujarat</span> across all major cities and industrial GIDC areas including remote districts.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-lg border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\">2. How quickly can I get service in Ahmedabad or Surat?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 leading-relaxed\">We offer <span class=\"highlight-gold\">same-day doorstep service</span> in Tier-1 cities like Ahmedabad, Surat, and Vadodara if booked before 12 PM.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-lg border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\">3. Are your spare parts compatible with Symphony and Bajaj?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 leading-relaxed\">Absolutely. Our <span class=\"highlight-orange\">air cooler repair services gujarat</span> use premium copper motors and high-lift pumps compatible with all major brands.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-lg border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\">4. Do you offer industrial maintenance in Dahej and Ankleshwar?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 leading-relaxed\">Yes, our <span class=\"highlight-gold\">industrial division</span> specializes in high-capacity cooling systems for the heavy chemical belt of South Gujarat.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-lg border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\">5. What is the benefit of Honeycomb pads in Gujarat&#8217;s climate?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 leading-relaxed\">Honeycomb pads offer <span class=\"highlight-orange\">30% higher cooling efficiency</span> and better durability against the hard water prevalent in many Gujarat districts.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-lg border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\">6. My cooler smells like rot. How can you fix it?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 leading-relaxed\">This is due to stagnant water bacteria. Our <span class=\"highlight-gold\">deep sanitization service</span> removes all algae and disinfects the tank for fresh air.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-lg border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\">7. Is there a warranty on your state-wide repair work?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 leading-relaxed\">Yes, we provide a <span class=\"highlight-orange\">standard 30-day service warranty</span> and part-specific manufacturer warranties across Gujarat.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-lg border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\">8. Can you repair digital touch-panel coolers?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 leading-relaxed\">Yes, we specialize in <span class=\"highlight-gold\">PCB circuit repair</span> for modern digital and remote-controlled air coolers.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-lg border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\">9. What are your visiting charges in smaller towns?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 leading-relaxed\">Our standard visiting charge is <span class=\"highlight-orange\">₹150</span> throughout Gujarat, which is adjusted if you proceed with the repair.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-lg border cursor-pointer group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold group-open:text-orange-600 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\">10. Do you provide emergency Sunday service?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 leading-relaxed\">During peak summer (March-June), we provide <span class=\"highlight-gold\">emergency cooling support</span> 7 days a week across the state.</p>\n                </details>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"bg-blue-950 text-white pt-24 pb-12\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 text-center\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Logo\" class=\"h-12 mb-8 filter brightness-0 invert mx-auto\" title=\"\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs opacity-70 uppercase font-black tracking-[0.3em] mb-6\">Leading provider of <span class=\"highlight-gold\">air cooler repair services gujarat</span> since 2011</p>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-center gap-8 text-[8px] uppercase font-bold opacity-40 mb-12\">\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-vadodara\">Vadodara</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-ahmedabad\">Ahmedabad</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-surat\">Surat</a>\n                <a href=\"/ac-repair-rajkot\">Rajkot</a>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-[10px] opacity-20 uppercase font-black tracking-[0.5em]\">Atlas Aircon © 2026 &#8211; Gujarat State Division</p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"fixed bottom-10 right-10 bg-green-500 text-white p-5 rounded-full shadow-2xl z-[200] hover:scale-110 transition active:scale-95\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg class=\"w-10 h-10 fill-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.588-5.946 0-6.556 5.332-11.888 11.888-11.888 3.176 0 6.161 1.237 8.404 3.48s3.481 5.229 3.481 8.405c0 6.556-5.332 11.888-11.888 11.888-2.022 0-4.005-.515-5.756-1.492l-6.23 1.635zm6.757-4.102l.484.288c1.46.868 3.141 1.326 4.86 1.326 5.178 0 9.388-4.21 9.388-9.388 0-2.508-.976-4.866-2.748-6.639s-4.13-2.747-6.639-2.747c-5.178 0-9.388 4.21-9.388 9.388 0 1.88.556 3.714 1.608 5.289l.315.474-1.047 3.824 3.922-1.029zm9.515-5.525c-.278-.139-1.643-.81-1.897-.903-.255-.092-.441-.139-.626.139s-.719.903-.881 1.088-.324.208-.602.069c-.278-.139-1.175-.433-2.239-1.381-.827-.738-1.385-1.65-1.547-1.928-.162-.278-.017-.429.121-.566.125-.123.278-.324.417-.486.139-.162.185-.278.278-.463.093-.185.046-.347-.023-.486s-.626-1.505-.858-2.061c-.226-.549-.454-.472-.626-.481-.162-.008-.347-.01-.533-.01s-.486.069-.741.347c-.255.278-.973.949-.973 2.315s.996 2.686 1.135 2.871c.139.185 1.961 2.995 4.749 4.195.663.286 1.181.457 1.585.586.666.212 1.272.182 1.751.11.534-.08 1.643-.671 1.875-1.319.232-.648.232-1.204.162-1.319-.069-.115-.255-.185-.533-.324z\"/></svg>\n    </a>\n\n</div>",
